WB, Ankwanda E, Wolfe RS (1982) Nutrition and carbon metabolism of Methanococcus voltae. J Bacteriol 149(3):852&#x02013;863 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">6801012</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR6"><label>6.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Mulrooney</surname><given-names>SB</given-names></name><name><surname>Hausinger</surname><given-names>RP</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Nickel uptake and utilization by microorganisms</article-title><source>FEMS Microbiol Rev</source><year>2003</year><volume>27</volume><issue>2&#x02013;3</issue><fpage>239</fpage><lpage>261</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0168-6445(03)00042-1</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Mulrooney SB, Hausinger RP (2003) Nickel uptake and utilization by microorganisms. FEMS Microbiol Rev 27(2&#x02013;3):239&#x02013;261 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12829270</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR7"><label>7.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gavel</surname><given-names>OY</given-names></name><name><surname>Bursakov</surname><given-names>SA</given-names></name><name><surname>Calvete</surname><given-names>JJ</given-names></name><name><surname>George</surname><given-names>GN</given-names></name><name><surname>Moura</surname><given-names>JJG</given-names></name><name><surname>Moura</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>ATP sulfurylases from sulfate-reducing bacteria of the genus <italic>Desulfovibrio</italic>. A novel metalloprotein containing cobalt and zinc</article-title><source>Biochemistry</source><year>1998</year><volume>37</volume><issue>46</issue><fpage>16225</fpage><lpage>16232</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1021/bi9816709</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Gavel OY, Bursakov SA, Calvete JJ, George GN, Moura JJG, Moura I (1998) ATP sulfurylases from sulfa